  "description": "Speed meets style – here comes the Multistreet 2 Fitness! Train when and how you want, no matter if you are a cycle commuter, a touring cyclist or a fitness freak. The lightweight, agile frame with a weight starting at approx. 1490 g impresses with a great finish and nice details. Smooth seams and a slim silhouette make it look great at that. This is primarily thanks to the use of 6013 T6/2 Altanium aluminium and a high-end carbon fork. Since sporty bikes don’t have to be uncomfortable, we have given the Multistreet GRX 400 an ergonomic saddle and grips. Schwalbe’s versatile G-ONE classic tyre rolls good on gravel and easy terrain. Carefully selected, reliable components by Shimano promise good performance and easy handling. * approx. 9.6 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt black/shiny grey/shiny-red frame, 19”, without pedals",
